@startuml call-step-model
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
left to right direction
title Extended model of the call execution step

interface StepContext

class CallContext {
  +method : HttpMethod
  +host : String
  +path : String
  +header : Map<String, Term>
  +query : Map<String, Term>
  +body : Map<String, Any>
  +authentication : Authentication[0..1]
  +timeoutInSeconds : Long[0..1]
  +result : String
  +resultType : ResultType
}

class InternalFunction <<new in this work>> {
  +name : String
  +deploymentDescriptorPath : String[0..1]
}

StepContext <|.. CallContext
CallContext "0..1" --> InternalFunction : internalFunction

note bottom of CallContext
  XOR invariant (enforced at DSL build time,
  re-checked by the resolvers):
  - external call: host != e AND internalFunction = null
  - internal call: internalFunction != null AND host = path = e
    (host/path injected by the resolver before rendering)
end note
@enduml
